                  "value": "/BT-118"
                },
                {
                  "const": "M"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "message": "An invoice line, a document level allowance or a document level charge or tax is categorised \"M\" (Ceuta and Melilla tax), and no VAT breakdown (BG-23) carries that VAT category code (BT-118).",
    "source": "EN 16931-1:2026, 6.4.3.4.15, Table 15, BR-IP-1",
    "note": "The 2017 edition asked for exactly one breakdown of the category; this edition asks for at least one, so a document with two of them is no longer wrong."
  },
